  "annotations_dropped": [
    {
      "annotation_id": "fbf3ccf553f74764833ff62648df7bff_39",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Having heard the learned counsel for the parties and on perusal of the appeal papers, the points that arise for our consideration in this appeal are:\ni. Whether the quantum of compensation awarded by the Tribunal is just and reasonable or d"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b1bc6719afe44a368af1acc9e63abdc2_40",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Whether the insurance company has made out sufficient grounds that the claimant has also contributed negligence in causing the accident?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d5431b6b887c44009120010f4616fccc_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nShriram General Insurance Com. Ltd vs Manik Tavanappa Gumaji on 7 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/51043199/\n4 11. Point No.ii:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bf0591f89866499dacf217f3296f65e6_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It appears that the Tribunal saddled the entire liability on the driver of the truck."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ba2868f6c6fb44ee8bd54d6c64ade65a_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nFrom the perusal of Ex.P-1-FIR, Ex.P-3-spot panchnama and Ex.R-6 charge- sheet clearly establish that the truck was parked on the left side of NH-4 and the driver of the said truck had parked his vehicle without there being any parking lig"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6caf7a8fbb1046f5a51b55d2c79eada9_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He could leave enough space between his vehicle and parked vehicle in front to react to sudden braking or unexpected road condition."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ce7b6e39bc1148c68a05532b0dae4003_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further accident occured due to NC: 2024:KHC-D:16287-DB carelessness of both the claimant and the driver of the truck and the accident could be avoided by following safety rules."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "635cc011fb3c4fa2afa3d6c4a8cf689e_46",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The claimant could have taken slight deviation during the relevant time."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "744da4e85d914f1cb045954e074d16e0_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, considering all these aspects, we are of the view that the claimant has also contributed negligence in causing the accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6f1392391bf74fd28354fa00a6e614be_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nTherefore, we are of the view that it is just and necessary to saddle negligence on the part of the claimant to an extent of 25% and 75% on the driver of the truck."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eb38ca54f5f34a2485efb0c509bb4f85_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n12. Point No.i:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5cbcda0a47c545f0a95c497da784d08a_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "So far as the quantum of compensation is concerned, the claimant himself examined as PW.1 and he relied upon 20 documents."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "65c6cbb82a6b4b17b5e7ebf984444eac_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The tribunal has observed that the claimant has sustained C3, C4 and C5 listesis with cord compression with quadriparesis."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2f262403c6c343f09814a3b0a9544237_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this regard, the claimant got examined PW-2-doctor P.C. Wali, who has assessed the permanent physical disability of the claimant."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f0c18524023f4114bf5648762654d11d_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "PW-2 has opined that the claimant is suffering from functional disability i.e.,\ninability to walk, difficulty in moving his upper limbs and lower limb, unable to move from the bed,\nunable to sit, unable to squat, unable to climb and is unab"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7fff90ececf64e6aa8594193e3605773_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, PW-2 has NC: 2024:KHC-D:16287-DB opined that the petitioner has suffered permanent physical disability of 80% to the whole body as per WHO and ALIMCOI Manual of Government of India and issued disability certificate at Ex.P.9."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c33b936af85149f8a0c82167acf672d5_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Considering the wound certificate and disability certificate, the Tribunal has awarded Rs.50,000/- towards food and nourishment,\nRs.1,50,000/- towards pain and suffering, Rs.2,67,626/- towards medical expenses, Rs.1,00,000/-\ntowards attenda"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "486a92dbc6a44f579145853d10f29505_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "So far as loss of future income due to permanent disability is concerned, the Tribunal has considered notional income of the claimant at Rs.9,000/- per month, which is on the higher side."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c6aafcb2beb445f3bb867171968be701_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the circular issued by the Karnataka State Legal Services Authority as well as High Court Legal Services Committee, for the accident of the year 2015, notional income is fixed at Rs.8,000/- per month."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0de2c1c6c1314b0f9d3dd02587d417da_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, Rs.8,000/- is taken into consideration."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "152af112573e41a8951de61ba5178505_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As on the date of the accident, the claimant was aged 39 years."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "be10d9c54270408687268a9dc12cb5f1_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, he is entitled to future - 10 - NC: 2024:KHC-D:16287-DB prospects at 40%."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9a9b312ed5fe4773941301856ad9a287_61",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus, loss of future earnings is reckoned as under:\nRs.8,000 + Rs.3,200/-(40%) =Rs.11,200/- Rs.11,200/- x 12 x 15 x 80%=\nRs.16,12,800/-\n"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "29184154e0c945b1a0e437681082f976_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Shriram General Insurance Com. Ltd vs Manik Tavanappa Gumaji on 7 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/51043199/\n5 14."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "56f2da38b2784836b24428d026d7a728_63",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus, the claimant is entitled to Rs.16,12,800/- towards loss of earnings as against Rs.12,96,000/- awarded by the Tribunal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3517f76bfcd14b399eac56b86ef83211_64",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "15. Thus, in all, the claimant is entitled to modified compensation as under:\nLoss of future earnings Rs.16,12,800/-\n Pain and suffering Rs. 1,50,000/-\n "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "19f79090e1c84a27af24ff25052ebdac_65",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Medical expenses Rs. 2,67,626/-\n Food and nourishment Rs. 50,000/-\n "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "af180a3c6448452593888ed4240a61c9_66",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Attendant charges Rs. 1,00,000/-\n Traveling expenses Rs. 20,000/-\n Loss of amenities in life Rs. 1,00,000/-\n Future medical expenses Rs. 1,00,000/-"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "88ddfce83d884c12ab96e1db2826d4e6_67",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n ------------------\n Total Rs.24,00426/-\n ------------------"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c12d0821f56c422f9909da43fd53a4a8_68",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "16. Thus, the claimant is entitled to compensation of Rs.24,00426/- as against Rs.20,83,626/- awarded by the Tribunal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e8dea91e861b4fffa33c170727d95f4d_69",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "17. As we have held that the claimant has contributed negligence in causing the accident to an extent of 25%, the - 11 - NC: 2024:KHC-D:16287-DB claimant is entitled to total compensation of Rs.18,00,319/- (i.e.\nRs.24,00,426x75%)."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3441a7aac5794bea898fe6f134b5dc55_70",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "18. Accordingly, we answer the points for consideration partly in the affirmative."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2b9941db248d45989cc84b1d630a4aee_71",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "19. In the result, we pass the following:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "687b4b6e0e074a13813933b5b6470758_72",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nORDER a) The appeals are allowed in part."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "748ec388206e427eb83884a07f5ec356_73",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The impugned judgment and award of the Tribunal is modified to an extent that the claimant is entitled to total compensation of Rs. 18,00,319/- with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition till realization."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "27e8faeb5ab24470a67dfd2252308dd5_74",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nb) The insurance company shall deposit the compensation with interest before the Tribunal within six weeks from the date of receipt of copy of this judgment."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8a84aadc98714a5d8fef0de05adecf7f_75",
      "summary_section": null,
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nc) Draw modified award accordingly."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "589042b3eaaa48169885b104c21228f0_77",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "d) Registry is directed transmit the amount in deposit to the Tribunal concerned."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ccda5870b562402493025ff61308bb36_79",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Registry is directed to send a copy of this judgment to the Tribunal forthwith."
    },
    {
